{"id":"y4eh5plhine2lo6ff4493f7i5","title":"钙催化亲核氟化反应","originalTitle":"Calcium catalysed nucleophilic fluorination","summary":"研究团队开发了一种新的钙基催化平台，用于亲核氟化反应。该平台利用钙氟化物作为氟化物载体，通过钙的电子和立体化学调控实现前所未有的选择性。这项工作展示了控制催化剂物种和试剂结合亲和力对于未来可持续非过渡金属催化体系发展的重要性。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Nature"},"links":{"original":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11445-z"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T00:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T17:07:25.207Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T17:07:25.207Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","Nature"],"score":45,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"d5d5805e-9202-48f8-bd07-d8882664d855","title":"钙催化亲核氟化反应取得进展"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Job J. C. Struijs","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"d5d5805e-9202-48f8-bd07-d8882664d855","title":"钙催化亲核氟化反应取得进展"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f23WHv1M54kA","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}